There are a ton more opportunities to be involved and get involved.

1127
01:58:29,087 --> 01:58:37,494
I'm gonna let Andrew go through some of those and wrap up the meeting, but just wanted to thank everybody for their involvement and participation tonight.

1128
01:58:38,255 --> 01:58:38,495
Andrew.

1129
01:58:39,255 --> 01:58:40,036
Thank you, Jason.

